<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Enter the IP Address that you want to allow access to</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-primary: #0f172a;
            --bg-card: #1e293b;
            --bg-input: #0f172a;
            --border-color: #334155;
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --accent: #3b82f6;
            --accent-hover: #2563eb;
            --info-bg: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
            --info-border: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1e293b 0%, var(--bg-primary) 70%);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .main {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 14px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 460px;
            padding: 2.25rem;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.45rem;
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
            color: #34d399;
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
            border-radius: 999px;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        .badge .dot {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #34d399;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.3;
            margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        .helper-box {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 1rem;
            background: var(--info-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--info-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .helper-box a {
            color: #60a5fa;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .helper-box a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
        }

        input[type="text"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.78rem 0.95rem;
            background: var(--bg-input);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
        }

        input[type="text"]:focus {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
        }

        input[type="submit"] {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.82rem 1rem;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.15s ease;
        }

        input[type="submit"]:hover {
            background: var(--accent-hover);
        }

        .footer-note {
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            padding-top: 1.1rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="main">
        <div class="badge"><span class="dot"></span> Email Verified</div>

        <h1>Laptop IP Address to Allow Access For</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Please enter the public IP address of your laptop to whitelist your connection.</p>

        <div class="helper-box">
            <span>Not sure what your public IP is?</span>
            <a href="https://www.whatsmyip.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">What's my laptop IP? &nearr;</a>
        </div>

        <form action="submit1.php" method="post">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="IPAddress">IP Address</label>
                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="IPAddress"
                    name="ipaddress"
                    placeholder="e.g. 203.0.113.42"
                    required
                    autocomplete="off"
                    autofocus
                >
            </div>
            <input type="submit" value="Submit">
        </form>

        <div class="footer-note">
            Protected by Wintersys Agile Deployment Toolkit
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
